{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49530","headline":"玉楼春 一 · 魏承班","name":"玉楼春 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂画堂梁上燕，高卷翠帘横数扇。\n一庭春色恼人来，满地落花红几片。\n愁倚锦屏低雪面，泪滴绣罗金缕线。\n好天凉月尽伤心，爲是玉郎长不见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}